---
description: Require production Convex deployments to come from committed and pushed main
alwaysApply: true
---

# Production Convex Deployments

- Never run `npx convex deploy` with local-only changes.
- Before deploying to Convex production, commit the intended code on `main` and
  push that commit to `origin/main`.
- Verify the push succeeds and local `HEAD` matches `origin/main` before the
  production deployment.
- Prefer the repository's normal deployment automation when available.
- If committing and pushing first is impossible, stop and ask the user for an
  explicit exception instead of deploying.
